vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jJRepI8RRY4Q7kNvwEpvNpo&_nc_oc=AdkMYS5PSjZ0oj-5sUFpy76E_5v837xIUydB4C9Ot7xrEDr3O-ddRuVn2OSOFgc-KzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwP5AcRkqdKTHimioAA3CMlJTvBT5zRaHXItEqbcQmF2g&oe=69AEC554"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NREJlKMTUyYQ7kNvwFbBLGb&_nc_oc=AdnfqjreV8Q5iI6_V0KG51ZsGDPsSZNeWlL-Vaqe3q6ipH9tCFF2SsNeqngYk3zV7aA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy_yqJuqfjWuq1RhVII5hj2XGZM7hdanY78l2hD4wsxKw&oe=69AECA32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rdwMh-8JdqoQ7kNvwF5qoqz&_nc_oc=Adne37vuaMNdvNQM4GgkptdW0hK2Q5y8muZpbC7TW0hSI517uin7d5YTiKM12dFFpAE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz5wUwrt0p8WFtU1dYj5p0P44iGLNB1wfmf0DYnCAZd7w&oe=69AED7D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "